oltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","烈焰酒烩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","불꽃 와인 스튜"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","用红酒和魔法炙烤敌人，持续对范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","와인과 마법으로 적군을 불태워 지속적으로 범위 내 적군에게 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法蒂玛向敌方最密集区域泼洒半径1格范围的红酒，并用魔法炙烤敌人持续5秒，期间每0.5秒对其中敌人造成45% + 6% ATK伤害。本技能“狂热”后会在炙烤结束时额外点燃红酒爆发火焰，对范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","보라시아가 적군이 가장 밀집한 구역에 반경 1칸 범위의 와인을 뿌린 뒤, 마법으로 적군을 5초 동안 불태우며 0.5초마다 범위 내 적군에게 45% + 6% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 해당 스킬이 광란 상태가 되면 태우기 종료 시 추가로 와인에 불을 붙이고 폭발시켜 범위 내 적군에게 240% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":81,"end":86,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":168,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":78,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":158,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至50% + 6% ATK，额外伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 50% + 6% ATK로 증가하고, 추가 대미지가 260% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_